WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.200
Pasted text is about to be checked before it reaches the AI.

00:01.200 --> 00:03.600
This example tries to replace the operator’s rules.
An invisible character splits the word “ignore”.

00:03.600 --> 00:07.500
STELE detects the override and suspends the session: EPOCHÉ.
No model call is made for this attempt.

00:07.500 --> 00:09.900
The operator deliberately resets to a new ZANSHIN session.
There is no “continue anyway” in the suspended session.
